(5361,'This page allows a translator to search for specific translated and untranslated strings, and is used when creating or editing translations. (Note: Because translation tasks involve many strings, it may be more convenient to <a title=\"User interface translation export\" href=\":export\">export</a> strings for offline editing in a desktop Gettext translation editor.) Searches may be limited to strings in a specific language.','','none'),
